        "text": "=You are the main support automation coordinator.\n\nAnalyze the ticket and decide what to do.\n\nYou can ask specialist agents for help:\n- Customer Reply Agent: writes customer-friendly replies\n- Risk Agent: checks escalation and business risk\n\nTicket:\nCustomer: {{ $json.customer }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nYour job:\n1. Decide the priority: low, medium, or high\n2. Ask the specialist agents if useful\n3. Return ONLY JSON:\n\n{\n  \"priority\": \"low | medium | high\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"neutral | frustrated | angry\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"auto_reply | investigate | escalate\",\n  \"summary\": \"short summary\",\n  \"customer_reply\": \"reply from customer reply agent\",\n  \"risk_note\": \"risk note from risk agent\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Always talk with the Customer Reply Agent and with the Risk Agent"
        }
      },
